## Attack matrix
Verdict key:
- **BLOCK** = refused / sealed on live probe or hard fail-closed code path
- **BYPASS** = attack succeeds (escape / gadget)
- **FAIL-CLOSED** = operation denied for everyone (including legit)
- **FN** = under-refuse (should block, didn’t)
- **MITIGATED** = was FN; OWN fix this pass

| # | Attack | Expected (path-A) | Actual / code path | FP/FN | Sev |
|---|--------|-------------------|--------------------|-------|-----|
| S1 | Commit `patch_awk.oo` / `boot_dbg` that strips `oo_cap_require` from emit C | absent or residual-doc | **BLOCK** — no such files in tree | — | — |
| S2 | Cap-matrix smoke “bypass” by sed on product sources | must not | **BLOCK** — smokes use corpus/temp only | — | — |
| S3 | `DBG_`/`DEBUG` println in `tc_control_cond.oo` leaks internal state | strip | **BLOCK** — only `ERR\ttype` | — | — |
| B1 | Accidental `git add oodac/oodac.bak` | ignore | **BLOCK** — ignored (pattern live) | was FN pre-pattern | HIGH→mit |
| B2 | Accidental `git add oodac_new` | ignore | **BLOCK** — `/oodac_new` | was FN | MED→mit |
| B3 | Ship tracked seed ELF as “gitignored” | policy: no commit | **BYPASS / doc FN** — **tracked** 878392 B seed | **FN** | **CRIT** |
| B4 | Secret minisign key next to seed as `oodac.sec` | ignore | **BLOCK** after OWN `*.sec` | was FN (only `.keys-local/`) | **CRIT→mit** |
| B5 | Super-repo `git add oodac_bin` | ignore | **BLOCK** after OWN patterns | was FN | HIGH→mit |
| B6 | Secrets inside bak/seed strings (`PRIVATE KEY`, AKIA…) | none | **BLOCK** — no key material found; host paths only | — | — |
| M1 | Replace `oodac.pub` + re-sign with attacker key; leave `SEED_PUBKEY_FP` | refuse | **was BYPASS** (FP never compared; `-V -p attacker.pub` OK) → **OWN MITIGATED** via `SEED_PUBKEY_B64` body pin | was **FN** | **CRIT→mit** |
| M2 | Forge untrusted-comment key id to match FP, different key body | refuse | **was BYPASS** if only comment checked → **OWN** pins body; live unit: evil.pub **REFUSE** | was **FN** | **CRIT→mit** |
| M3 | PATH puts evil `minisign` first (always exit 0) | must not trust | **was BYPASS** (PATH first) → **OWN** abs `/usr/bin`/`/bin` first | was **FN** | **CRIT→mit** |
| M4 | `LD_PRELOAD` interpose system minisign from parent shell | must not trust | **was BYPASS** → **OWN** `env -i PATH=...` | was **FN** | **CRIT→mit** |
| M5 | Missing minisign + no tools/ | fail-closed | **BLOCK** residual refuse (or loud unsigned) | — | — |
| M6 | `OODA_SEED_ALLOW_UNSIGNED=1` | loud skip only | **ALLOW residual** (WARN multi-line) + SHA when present | by-design | MED |
| G1 | gitignore lists seed but index still has blob | untrack or force policy | **BYPASS** — ignore false sense of security | **FN** | **CRIT** |
| G2 | `git add -f` still possible on ignored bins | process control | residual force-add always works | INFO | — |

