## OWN fix applied (CRITICAL only)
### 1) Minisign trust-path — both bootstrap scripts
**Files:**
- `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/scripts/bootstrap_no_cargo.oo`
- `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/scripts/bootstrap_2stage.oo`

| Change | Why |
|--------|-----|
| `SEED_PUBKEY_B64=RWS3WGBOo2lQZGh3eFa0Gq0h6vDb9rCE5ZoaExEGdSko44OiPDdTVm8i` | pin **key material** (pub line 2), not untrusted comment |
| Compare pub body to pin before `-V` | stop substitute-pub + re-sign forgery while FP string stays green |
| Comment FP mismatch also refuse | defense-in-depth / log honesty |
| Resolve minisign `/usr/bin` → `/bin` → `tools/` → PATH | stop PATH-first verifier hijack |
| `env -i PATH=/usr/bin:/bin minisign -V ...` | stop `LD_PRELOAD` / gadget env interpose (T3 parity) |

**Not fixed here:** untracking committed seed; CI release-asset-only bootstrap; signing tools/minisign if vendored later.

### 2) gitignore — secret + host binary gaps
**File:** `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/.gitignore`
- `*.sec`, `*.secret.key`, `**/minisign.key`
- `/tools/minisign`

**File:** `/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/.gitignore`
- `/oodac_bin`, `/oodac_bin_new`, `/test_pthread`, `/test_pthread.c`
- `*.sec`, `*.secret.key`

**Already on tree (peer hygiene WIP, kept):** `/oodac/oodac.bak*`, `/oodac/oodac.new`, `/oodac_new`, tmp patterns.

**No push.**

