## What T4 path-A is **not**
> Ignoring bak files + pinning minisign pubkey body is **not** a full reproducible-build seal, **not** an attestation of seed provenance beyond the maintainer key, **not** a substitute for untracking the seed ELF, and **not** a guarantee against an attacker who can rewrite bootstrap scripts in the same PR as the seed.

Re-open T4 security only if: (a) pubkey body pin or clean-env verifier regresses, (b) cap-strip scripts reappear without residual doc, (c) secret keys land in git history, (d) bak/host ELFs become tracked.

